# hair/adult/longloose: Long loose: parted in the middle, straight past the shoulders, the ears hidden
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to HAIR in wave 2). On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
